      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Say this posted refered to in another post, this would be awesome to split up users within the same instance and reduce overall load. Not only that, but because portals show how many are within the instance we could still view where other users are. Creating game worlds that could be \"open world\" themed would be lesser in size, and easier to fix and work on updates in certain sections instead of risking the whole entire world messing up or scripts breaking.",
